        " قَالَ أَبُو عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) إِذَا شَكَكْتَ فِي تَسْبِيحِ فَاطِمَةَ الزَّهْرَاءِ ( عليها السلام ) فَأَعِدْ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ahmad Bin Idrees, from Muhammad Bin Ahmad, raising it, said, ",
          "‘Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘When you have a doubt in the Glorification (<span class=\"iTxt\">Tasbīḥ</span>) of Syeda Fatima Al-Zahra<sup>asws</sup>, so repeat’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "11. Ahmad ibn Idris from Muhammad ibn Ahmad in a marfu‘ manner has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘If you face uncertainty about Tasbih of Fatimah al- Zahra’, ‘Alayha al-Salam, say it again.’” "
        ]
      }
